<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Missouri Housing Commission.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Missouri Housing Commission.</headline>
<text>
<p>MISSOURI HOUSING DEVELOPMENT COMMISSION</p>
<p>RE: $64,715,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
